# Godot's import cache. A clean checkout must build its own (`docs/ACCEPTANCE.md` §4.1); the
# launcher does it.
.godot/
# The launcher's local world saves (`./mineworld-2d`, `--fresh` deletes one).
.save/
# Capture output is scratch, except the preview package, which is the reviewed artefact (ARC-24).
shots/*
!shots/preview/
# The Demo A stills of the VIS-2D-1 package (PR 13f), one folder per world.
!shots/demo-a/
# The far-field regression views (RL-e0 §7), one folder per world, are committed too.
!shots/market-town/
shots/market-town/*
!shots/market-town/farfield/
!shots/social-cafe/
shots/social-cafe/*
!shots/social-cafe/farfield/
!shots/lakeside/
shots/lakeside/*
!shots/lakeside/farfield/
!shots/bodies-yard/
shots/bodies-yard/*
!shots/bodies-yard/farfield/
*.import
